- “Continue as Admin.”
- User/Admin selection cards.
- Demo credentials.
- Pre-filled email addresses.
- Pre-filled passwords.
- Fake authentication success messages.

All authentication input fields must be empty when the page opens.

Use actual Supabase Auth for account creation, email/password sign-in, session restoration, password recovery, and sign-out.

Do not accept a login simply because an input field contains a particular hardcoded value.

